.TH MIKROTIK-HOME-NETFLOW-PLUS-FETCH-ASN 8 "October 2026" "mikrotik-home-netflow-plus" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
mikrotik-home-netflow-plus-fetch-asn \- download the organisation (ASN) database for mikrotik-home-netflow-plus
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mikrotik-home-netflow-plus-fetch-asn
.SH DESCRIPTION
Downloads the current IP to ASN Lite database published by DB-IP
(https://db-ip.com, Creative Commons Attribution 4.0) to
.I /var/lib/mikrotik-home-netflow-plus/asn.mmdb
so that destinations without a DNS name are labelled with the organisation
that owns the address, for example "Cloudflare" instead of a bare address.
If the service is running it is restarted, because the database is read at
start.
.PP
A new edition is published every month; run the command again to refresh.
It must run as root, needs
.BR curl (1)
or
.BR wget (1),
and needs the data directory to exist, which it does once the service has
started. Set
.B NFP_DATA_DIR
to use a different directory.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mikrotik-home-netflow-plus (8)
